\newlabel{tab:ch15-forces}{{1.1}{11}{The forces of \cref {ex:ch15-disc} at the three probe points of \cref {fig:ch15-field} ($k_{\mathrm {att}} = k_{\mathrm {rep}} = 1$, $\rho _0 = 2$). At $B$ the repulsion beats the attraction although the goal is straight ahead; at $C$ the two forces are at an angle and their sum turns the drone around the obstacle}{table.caption.11}{}}
